      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Shadow [zone=915]\n**Who:**\n- Eoqua Din [npc=43127]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Shadowed Carp [item=111105]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a shadowy lurker [npc=43296]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Apr 17 17:16:50 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Eoqua Din ( map) in the Plane of Shadow (findable with CTRL+F), found at location 970, 3010, -18 (on one of the islands on the west side outside the palace)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\nYou say, 'Hail, Eoqua Din'\nEoqua Din blurts out what you believe to be Akhevan obscenities as you approach. 'Yes, what is it? Can't you see that I am busy trying to fish up some dinner? Who am I kidding? I am a horrible fisherman. Everytime I snag a shadowed carp, the [lurkers] come and steal it from my line.'\nYou say, 'Lurkers?'\nEoqua Din says 'Shadowy lurkers. They are horrible beasts who delight in torturing me by preventing me from catching my dinner. If they didn't terrify me, I would jump right into the water and rip the carp from their maws. You look pretty brave. [Kill] some of the lurkers, rip open their stomachs, and return a shadowed carp to me and I will make it worth your while.'\nYou say, 'I'll kill some of them'\nEoqua Din says 'I await your return; unless you get eaten alive by one of the lurkers.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Shadowy Lurkers'.\n\n---\n\nKill some shadowy lurkers 0/6 (Plane of Shadow)\nLoot a shadowed carp from a shadowy lurker 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Note: Shadowy lurkers spawn in the water in the western part of the zone (outside the palace)._\nGive the shadowed carp to Eoqua Din 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nSpeak with Eoqua Din 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n112 platinum, 5 gold",
