      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Shadow [zone=915]\n**Who:**\n- Xilk the Exile [npc=43132]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Apr 17 17:17:17 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Xilk the Exile ( map) in the Plane of Shadow (findable with CTRL+F). She is found at 1400, 1635, -16 (west side, outside the palace)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\nYou say, 'Hail, Xilk the Exile'\nXilk the Exile laughs uncontrollably as you near him. This Akhevan clearly is not in his right mind. 'Father? Is that you, father? You have been gone for so long. The pools made of [darkness]! They did this to us, father! They made you leave me! Kill them! Kill them all!'\nYou say, 'Darkness?'\nXilk the Exile says 'Always bubbling, always troubling, these creatures are. They hide in the tower, just behind me. Kill them, father! Kill them!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Darkness'.\n\n---\n\nKill some pools of darkness 0/6 (Plane of Shadow)\n_These are found throughout the lower halls of the palace._\nSpeak with Xilk the Exile 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n112 platinum, 5 gold",
