      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Shadow [zone=915]\n**Who:**\n- Aten Ha Ra [npc=43126]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Crystal Shard [item=110936]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Kela Lor Telaris [npc=43129]\n- a corrupted Akhevan [npc=43277]\n- an Akhevan vagabond [npc=43302]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Breaking the Seal [quest=6832]\n- Dispelling the Shadows [quest=6833]\n- Shadow #2: Aten's Wrath [quest=6830]\n- Shadow #3: Dial L for Luclin [quest=6831]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Apr 17 17:42:40 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task and is the first task in a series of three. It begins with Aten Ha Ra ( map), findable with CTRL+F, who is found just inside the palace entrance._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\nYou say, 'Hail, Aten Ha Ra'\nAten Ha Ra doesn't even look at you as she speaks 'Lumanes \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ Something disastrous has occurred here. A strange [crystal shard] crashed into Vex Thal and pierced the veil to Vex Xi Va, the domain of my Goddess.' She turns her gaze fully upon you. 'The sanctity of this holy place has been defiled.'\nYou say, 'What about the crystal shard?'\nAten Ha Ra says 'This shard must have enormous power to force its way into the planes. Already its presence is changing Her domain in unexpected ways. I have tasked the Akhevans to find any [pieces] of this shard and remove it from the Plane of Shadow immediately. As Her holy servants, it is our duty to cleanse the home of our Goddess and seal the breach to Her domain.'\nYou say, 'What pieces?'\nAten Ha Ra says 'The crystal broke apart into many pieces upon entering Vex Xi Va. I have tasked my most trusted priest Diabo Va Xin Vellis to head our efforts to collect the shards and return them to me. However, it has been quite some time since he has reported back with shards and none of my priests have been able to [locate] him.'\nYou say, 'I will locate him'\nAten Ha Ra says 'You? You should not even be here! If it was not for this crisis, you would already be dead for defiling this place. Still, I must know how the cleanup is progressing and my people are spread thinly. I will allow you look for Diabo Va Xin Vellis. Should you find him, inform him he is to return immediately with the shards he has collected.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Goddess, the Shard, and the Diabo'.\nYou have been tasked by Aten Ha Ra to find Diabo Va Xin Vellis and instruct him to return with all the shards he has gathered.\n\n---\n\nSearch for Diabo Va Xin Vellis in the ancient battlefield 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_This location update ( map) is findable via CTRL+F (this is the southwestern valley outside the palace)._\nAsk akhevan vagabonds in the area about Diabo Va Xin Vellis 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Akhevan vagabonds ( map) are found throughout the battlefield area. Say 'Diabo Va Xin Vellis' to one of them to update this step._\nYou say, 'What about Diabo Va Xin Vellis?'\nan Akhevan vagabond eyes you warily but somehow knows you have been sent by Aten Ha Ra. 'Yes, he was here many hours ago. After collecting all the shards in this area, he headed toward the Darkfire Islands.'\n\n---\n\nSearch for Diabo Va Xin Vellis at the darkfire islands 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_This is a large update area ( map) in the western part of the outside area._\nAsk akhevan vagabonds in the area about Diabo Va Xin Vellis 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Akhevan vagabonds ( map) are found throughout the islands. Say 'Diabo Va Xin Vellis' to one of them to update this step._\nYou say, 'What about Diabo Va Xin Vellis?'\nan Akhevan vagabond looks at you with distrust as they answer,'Diabo Va Xin Vellis already collected all the shards which could be found here some time ago. He departed to speak with mercenary leader Kela Lor Telaris inside the temple. He has set up his command post at the top of the eastern root passage.'\n\n---\n\nEnter Luclin's Palace via the eastern root passage 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_In the far eastern area outside the palace ( map) is a palace entrance. This updates around there (/loc 100, -1225, -55)._\nSpeak to Kela Lor Telaris about Diabo Va Xin Vellis 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Kela Lor Telaris ( map) is findable with CTRL+F. She is found in the far southeastern part of the palace (head up inside tree - he is in the first room)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kela Lor Telaris'\nKela Lor Telaris says 'I do not have time to talk now, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. My mercenaries are being pressed hard by maddened akhevans. They seem to be stronger than I would have thought possible. We are barely holding our position in the chamber behind me.'\n\n---\n\nInvestigate the battle in the chamber to the north 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Head north ( map)._\nYou survey the carnage and quickly decide the mercenaries could use some help.\nKill 3 corrupted Akhevans 0/3 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Any three count towards this step. These range in level from 100-101 and are stunnable/mezzable._\na corrupted Akhevan says 'For Diabo Va Xin Vellis!'\na corrupted Akhevan has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na corrupted Akhevan's corpse violently crashes to the ground.\nObtain a crystal shard from a corrupted Akhevan 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n\n---\n\nReturn the crystal shard to Aten Ha Ra 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nAten Ha Ra listens intently, her face betraying no emotion as you relay your findings. 'I did not expect something like this could happen. These shards are more dangerous than I thought. We must find what has happened to Diabo Va Xin Vellis and recover the shards he collected.'\nYou were unable to locate Diabo Va Xin Vellis, but you did find a clue as to what may have happened to him.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (3 AAs + 2% regular exp at Level 100)\n112 platinum, 5 gold",
