      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Shadow [zone=915]\n**Who:**\n- Aten Ha Ra [npc=43126]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Aten Ha Ra's Orders [item=110938]\n- Chest of Crystal Shards [item=110941]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Kela Lor Telaris [npc=43129]\n- Zentha Lor Thall [npc=43309]\n- a corrupted Akhevan [npc=43277]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Breaking the Seal [quest=6832]\n- Dispelling the Shadows [quest=6833]\n- Shadow #1: The Goddess, the Shard, and the Diabo [quest=6829]\n- Shadow #3: Dial L for Luclin [quest=6831]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Apr 17 17:43:02 2013\nModified: Thu Feb 29 21:11:14 2024 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task and is the second task in a series of three. It begins with Aten Ha Ra ( map), findable with CTRL+F, who is found just inside the palace entrance._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completion of \"The Goddess, the Shard, and the Diabo\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Aten Ha Ra'\nAten Ha Ra is clearly displeased as she speaks, 'It seems these shards have a power that is able to corrupt the soul. Obviously they do not have this effect on everyone, so I must conclude this is a [weakness] inherent those who are affected.'\nYou say, 'What weakness?'\nAten Ha Ra raises her voice in anger, 'This weakness will not be tolerated! Those akhevans who fall to the power of these shards are not fit to live amongst our people. They must be purged and any shards they possess must be recovered!' Aten Ha Ra regains her composure. 'There is also the matter of Diabo Va Xin Vellis. We must know if he has been affected by the shards. The [mercenaries] may prove useful after all.'\nYou say, 'What mercenaries?'\nAten Ha Ra says 'Who better to conduct a purge than Kela Lor Telaris and his mercenaries? And since they have not yet succumbed to the power of the shards, they should be able to handle collecting them. \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, you may continue to avoid my wrath by [delivering] these [orders] and assisting him in whatever way he may require.'\nYou say, 'I will deliver these orders'\nAten Ha Ra says 'A wise decision, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.' Aten Ha Ra fixes you with an icy stare 'I will not tolerate failure in this. Return with news of success or do not return at all.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Aten's Wrath'.\nYou have been tasked by Aten Ha Ra to assist Kela Lor Telaris in eliminating the corrupt Akhevans and recovering any shards in their possession.\n\n---\n\nDeliver the orders to Kela Lor Telaris 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Kela Lor Telaris ( map) is findable with CTRL+F. He is found in the far southeastern part of the palace (head up inside tree - he is in the first room)._\nKela Lor Telaris reads over the orders. 'So that is what we must do. The corrupted akhevans have infested the area around Luclin's chambers. Chests of crystal shards are strewn about there as well. Go there, kill them, and bring back their shards. My mercenaries will attack on a different front than you with the same objective. Keep an eye out for signs of Diabo Va Xin Vellis.\n\n---\n\nKill 15 corrupted Akhevans 0/15 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Corrupted Akhevans are found all throughout the hallways in the upper levels of the zone, as well as in the chamber north of Kela Lor Telaris and in Luclin's chamber._\nCollect 5 chests of crystal shards 0/5 (Plane of Shadow)\n_These are ground spawns located in and all around Luclin's chamber ( map \\-\\- upper levels of the eastern part of the palace)._\n\n---\n\nInterrogate a corrupted Zentha Lor Thall priestess 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Kill \"Zentha Lor Thall\" ( map). One of these can be found in each of the hallways that extend out from the same area._\n_She hits for a max ~14,000 and doesn't have any special abilities. As she lowers in health, she will go on about Diabo Va Xin Vellis' plans:_\nZentha Lor Thall says 'You cannot stop Diabo Va Xin Vellis! He has ascended to a more powerful form through the power of the shards.'\nZentha Lor Thall says 'Very soon now he will be powerful enough to break the seal to Luclin's inner chamber, claiming the large shard that lies within.'\nZentha Lor Thall says 'He will then destroy Luclin and take her place as the ruler of this plane! If you oppose him, you too shall be destroyed.'\nZentha Lor Thall has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\n\n---\n\nDeliver 5 chests of crystal shards to Kela Lor Telaris 0/5 (Plane of Shadow)\nYou can preloot the chests but you will have to give them to a merc or NPC to hand them back to you in order to get updates for this step.\nInform Kela Lor Telaris of what you have learned about Diabo Va Xin Vellis 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nYou say, 'Hail, Kela Lor Telaris'\nKela Lor Telaris says 'He is mad! Attempting to kill Luclin and become the God of Shadow? We must get to this large crystal shard before Diabo Va Xin Vellis and stop this insanity.'\nYou killed many corrupt akhevans and recovered their crystal shards, but Diabo Va Xin Vellis has already become powerful enough to challenge Luclin.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (2-3% regular exp in Level 100 + 3 AAs)\n150 platinum",
