      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Shadow [zone=915]\n**Who:**\n- Kela Lor Telaris [npc=43129]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Triangulation Shard Delta [item=111152]\n- Triangulation Shard Epsilon [item=111123]\n- Triangulation Shard Gamma [item=111114]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Plane of Shadow: Breaking the Seal [zone=919]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Diabo Va Xin Vellis [npc=43403]\n- Kaas Thox [npc=43398]\n- Kela Lor Telaris [npc=43392]\n- Kela Va [npc=43404]\n- Kela Vas Strongbox [npc=43171]\n- Sealing Crystal [npc=43401]\n- The Dark Lady [npc=43402]\n- Volx Xi Xakra [npc=43397]\n- Xundraux Xakra [npc=43395]\n- Zel Kaxri [npc=43396]\n- a corrupted akhevan scout [npc=43394]\n- a crystal shard [npc=43400]\n- a pile of shadow [npc=43399]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dispelling the Shadows [quest=6833]\n- Raid Expedition: Dispelling the Shadows [quest=6840]\n- Shadow #1: The Goddess, the Shard, and the Diabo [quest=6829]\n- Shadow #2: Aten's Wrath [quest=6830]\n- Shadow #3: Dial L for Luclin [quest=6831]\n- The Depths of Fear [quest=6924]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Apr 17 17:43:45 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a group mission that begins with Kela Lor Telaris (findable with CTRL+F) who is found in the far southeastern part of the palace (head up inside tree - he is in the first room)._\n_For a visual of how to safely get to this area, see the image on this NPC entry [npc=43161]._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completion of \"The Goddess, the Shard, and the Diabo\"\n\\- Completion of \"Aten's Wrath\"\n\\- Completion of \"Dial L for Luclin\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Kela Lor Telaris'\nKela Lor Telaris says 'We must find a way to break the seal on Luclin's Chamber before Diabo Va Xin Vellis can get to the shard! Your assistance thus far has been very helpful. I would like you to [accompany] me on this mission.'\nYou say, 'We will accompany you'\nKela Lor Telaris says 'Excellent. I will be glad to have you with me. Let me know when you are ready to [depart], but prepare quickly. We have no time to waste.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Breaking the Seal'.\nYou have agreed to accompany Kela Lor Telaris in his attempt to break the seal on Luclin's chamber.\nYou say, 'Let's depart'\nKela Lor Telaris says 'Let us be off.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Plane of Shadow.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Kela Lor Telaris 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nYou say, 'Hail, Kela Lor Telaris'\nKela Lor Telaris says 'Our first step should be to investigate the sealed doors more thoroughly and see if we can determine what type of magic is sealing them. Wait, did you hear something?'\nKela Lor Telaris says 'Over there on the stairs! Don't let him report back!'\n_This triggers the spawn of \"a corrupted akhevan scout\" on the stairs to the east._\nTry to kill the corrupted akhevan scout before he reports back 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_You can either kill the scout or let him run off on his own (the step will update either way). If you kill it, the step simply updates:_\na corrupted Akhevan scout has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\na corrupted Akhevan scout's corpse still clutches its sword.\n_If you let it go, you'll eventually see this, updating the step (Xundraux Xakra kills the scout):_\nXundraux Xakra shouts 'Fool! You led them right to me!'\n\n---\n\nKill Xundraux Xakra 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Xundraux Xakra ( map) casts \"Deathly Poison\" (DOT for 50,000/tick) on a random target every 25 seconds (viral to anyone in 40' range)._\nDeathly Poison: Single Target, Disease (-960)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 50000 per tick\n2: Decrease Endurance by 4000 per tick\n3: Increase Poison Counter by 90\nXundraux Xakra has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nXundraux Xakra's corpse lets out a deep sigh.\nSearch Xundraux Xakra for anything useful 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Loot a \"Triangulation Shard Gamma\" from its corpse._\nGive triangulation shard gamma to Kela Lor Telaris 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nYou hear the sound of furniture being knocked over in the room down the hall.\nKela Lor Telaris says 'Interesting, a triangulation crystal. They must be using a sealing crystal to lock these doors. If we can get the other two crystals, we will be able to locate the sealing crystal and destroy it. We should probably search outside the other two entrances to Luclin's chamber.'\n_This spawns Zel Kaxri and Volx Xi Xakra ( map), as well as Kaas Thox. (Kaas Thox is an optional kill, but killing it will generate an extra item in your loot chest.)_\n\n---\n\nKill Zel Kaxri 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Zel Kaxri casts \"Repel\" (with knockback) on a random target every 20 seconds._\nRepel: Single Target, Unresistable (0)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 40000\nZel Kaxri has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nZel Kaxri's corpse's face seems peaceful now.\nSearch Zel Kaxri for a triangulation shard 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Loot \"Triangulation Shard Delta\" from its corpse._\nGive triangulation shard delta to Kela Lor Telaris 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nKela Lor Telaris says 'Only one more to go.'\n\n---\n\nKill Volx Xi Xakra 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Every 30 seconds, Volx Xi Xakra buffs itself with \"Power of Fear\". Dispell this quickly because it AEs \"Shards of Fear\" if it fades naturally._\nVolx Xi Xakra has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nVolx Xi Xakra's corpse lies flat on the ground.\nSearch Volx Xi Xakra for a triangulation shard 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Loot \"Triangulation Shard Epsilon\" from its corpse._\nGive triangulation shard epsilon to Kela Lor Telaris 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nKela Lor Telaris says 'Now that we have all three, I can lead us to the location of the Sealing Crystal. Follow me!'\nFollow Kela Lor Telaris to the Sealing Crystal 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n\n---\n\nDestroy the Sealing Crystal 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_NOTE: The task locks upon the Sealing Crystal's destruction._\n_This is located in the northwestern part of the palace ( map)._\n_Here, you will get adds called \"a crystal shard\" here. These are kiteable and should be range DPS'd (large damage aura on them). Kill the crystal to unlock the doors to Luclin's chamber._\n_Emotes you'll see here:_\nA shard of the sealing crystal breaks off. _(\"a crystal shard\" spawns and targets someone else.)_\nYou are being pursued by a crystal shard. Don't let it get close! _(\"a crystal shard\" spawns and targets you.)_\n_As the Sealing Crystal is destroyed, you see:_\nThe sealing crystal falls to pieces.\nA keening wail suddenly fills the air of the chamber, only to trail off moments later.\n_This also spawns Kela Va and The Dark Lady ( map). (The Dark Lady is an optional kill, but killing her will generate an extra item in your loot chest.)_\n\n---\n\n_Optional Kills:_\n_Kaas Thox hits for a max ~19,500 and spawns adds at 80%, 70%, 50%, and 20% (two per wave). These adds each have a melee slow aura (Sticky Tendrils) and cast a spell on random targets that flings the target to their location._\nKaas Thox has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nKaas Thox's corpse evaporates into a fetid mist.\n_The Dark Lady hits for a max ~19,500 and casts the emote-based \"Gaze of Shadows\" occurring at specific health intervals: 80%, 70%, 50%, and 20% (turn away from her when you see it)._\nThe Dark Lady turns her gaze upon you! You think it would be wise to avoid looking at her.\nThe Dark Lady turns her gaze away fro you.\nThe Dark Lady has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nThe Dark Lady's corpse collapses.\n\n---\n\nEnter Luclin's chamber 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nDiabo Va Xin Vellis shouts 'How resourceful of you to have broken my seal. If I was not otherwise occupied, I would destroy you myself. Kela Va will see to you in my place.'\nDefeat Kela Va 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Kela Va will hit the tank with \"Grim Siphon\" (single-target nuke for 40,000) which also increases her mana, which, when it hits 100%, causes her to AE \"Fearful Blast\" (AE nuke for 66,666)._\nKela Va has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nAs Kela Va falls to the ground, a small chest tumbles to the ground beneath her.\nClaim your reward from Kela Va's Strongbox 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nYou helped Kela Lor Telaris break the seal on Luclin's chamber so you could confront Diabo Va Xin Vellis and recover the large fear shard.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (4 AAs + 3-4% regular exp at Level 100)\n300 platinum\n_Possible Chest Loot (1 Dreadmote + 1-3 Items Per Task):_\nBestial Shoulderpads\nCloak of the North\nDulled Shissar Ulak\nEffigy of the Scorned\nEye of the Hierophant\nNecklace of Dark Beauty\nPauldrons of Rage\nQuicksilver Globule\nSash of Mystic Rites\nShissar Overseer's Pauldrons\nShissar Scaled Shoulders\nSilver Cymbals\nStudly Stud\nSturdy Gorget\nMedian Dreadmote\nGreater Dreadmote\nGlowing Dreadmote\nThis also drops a \"Shifting Shard\" - used in the **Depths of Fear** [quest=6924] class-specific weapon achievement.\n- Bestial Shoulderpads [item=111242]\n- Cloak of the North [item=111231]\n- Dulled Shissar Ulak [item=111243]\n- Effigy of the Scorned [item=111232]\n- Eye of the Hierophant [item=110993]\n- Glowing Dreadmote [item=106497]\n- Greater Dreadmote [item=106464]\n- Median Dreadmote [item=106509]\n- Necklace of Dark Beauty [item=111197]\n- Pauldrons of Rage [item=111177]\n- Quicksilver Globule [item=110622]\n- Sash of Mystic Rites [item=111135]\n- Shifting Shard [item=56896]\n- Shissar Overseer's Pauldrons [item=111134]\n- Shissar Scaled Shoulders [item=111153]\n- Silver Cymbals [item=111265]\n- Studly Stud [item=111230]\n- Sturdy Gorget [item=111133]",
