      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Shadow [zone=915]\n**Who:**\n- Vex Derex Lux [npc=43130]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Eye of Xin Va [item=111107]\n- Fragment of Vex Derex Lux [item=110992]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an essence of xin va [npc=43304]\n- sentient essence of xin va [npc=43477]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Apr 17 17:45:35 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a solo task that begins with Vex Derex Lux ( map) at location 800, 935, 31 (in the dervish room west of the palace entry room: findable with CTRL+F)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\nYou say, 'Hail, Vex Derex Lux'\nVex Derex Lux billows threateningly, 'You are either [brave] or [foolish] to dare approach me. Tell me, which is it?'\nYou say, 'I am brave, of course!'\nVex Derex Lux lets loose a laugh like a maelstrom of angry steam, 'Hah! A fool will think themselves brave when they do not know the danger they face! Now I will teach you-' It stops, suddenly growing calm, then continues in a gentle, breezy tone, '-anything I can that may help you in your journey. Alas! For myself, I am [beyond help].'\nYou say, 'Beyond help?'\nVex Derex Lux sighs gustily, 'It's so lonesome here, that sometimes I wish I were just a mindless essence like the others who roam this hall. Though we are all formed of the same basic elements, only I can speak and think. Alone, it is a burden, but [shared], I feel it would be the greatest gift imaginable.'\nYou say, 'Shared?'\nVex Derex Lux says 'I have long pondered how to bestow intelligence upon my fellow essences, and believe I have found a means, however, it is beyond my skill to carry out myself. If you would aid me, however, my dream of building my own army may finally come to fruition!''\n_You receive a \"Fragment of Vex Derex Lux\"._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Cannibalism for Fun and Profit'.\n\n---\n\nLoot 6 Eye of Xin Va 0/6 (Plane of Shadow)\n_These are dropped by dervish mobs inside the palace._\nUse the Fragment of Vex Derex Lux on an essence of xin va 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nForce feed the eyes of its kin to the sentient essence of xin va 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nSpeak with the sentient essence of xin va 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nDefend yourself against the sentient essence of xin va! 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nReport to Vex Derex Lux 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (regular + 4 AAs)\n225 platinum",
