      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Shadow [zone=915]\n**Who:**\n- Vex Derex Lux [npc=43130]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ectoplasm [item=110937]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Apr 17 17:45:54 2013\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\n_This is a solo task that begins with Vex Derex Lux ( map) at location 800, 935, 31 (in the dervish room west of the palace entry room: findable with CTRL+F)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No task requirements\nYou say, 'Hail, Vex Derex Lux'\nVex Derex Lux billows threateningly, 'You are either [brave] or [foolish] to dare approach me. Tell me, which is it?'\nYou say, 'Foolish...'\nVex Derex Lux rumbles in surprise, 'One who admits what they do not know can only be called wise.' It shifts, its voice taking on a gentler tone, 'Perhaps you could [solve] a riddle that has puzzled me for many ages?'\nYou say, 'Solve?'\nVex Derex Lux says 'To the Northeast lies a hall, upon whose walls ancient runes are inscribed. They call out to me, and I sense something familiar, yet I cannot read them. I feel these runes are important to me, and would ask you to [read] them and tell me what you've learned.'\nYou say, 'I will read them'\nVex Derex Lux says 'I've learned the runes may only be read by those whose eyes possess a certain quality. And though your eyes may not, the spirits who haunt that hall are known to be able to read the runes. I believe this quality may be gained temporarily by applying their ectoplasm on one's eyes.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Here's Ectoplasm in Your Eye!'.\nVex Derex Lux has asked you to head to the hall of records, to the northeast, and find a way to decipher the ancient runes. They can only be read by 'one whose eyes possess a certain quality' - whatever that means.\n\n---\n\nLoot 4 Ectoplasm 0/4 (Plane of Shadow)\nUse the Ectoplasm to read the runes on the North Wall - 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nNorth Wall 1699, -959, 33\nUse the Ectoplasm to read the runes on the East Wall - 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nEast Wall 1470, -1194, 33\nUse the Ectoplasm to read the runes on the South Wall - 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nSouth Wall 1330, -963, 33\nUse the Ectoplasm to read the runes on the West Wall - 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\nWest Wall 1469, -728, 33\nSpeak with Vex Derex Lux - 0/1 (Plane of Shadow)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience (regular + 4 AAs)\n225 platinum\nNeed locations for quest updates, missing dialogues, faction hits if any.",
